{"id":"nemnogo","lemma":"немного","pos":"adv","rank":121,"glosses":["a little, some"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/35/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Можешь дать мне немного времени?","en":"Can you give me some time?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267709","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to give"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"}]},{"text":"Пожалуйста, подождите немного.","en":"Please wait a bit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/727729","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to wait","l":"подождать"},null]},{"text":"Я могу немного поговорить.","en":"I can speak a little.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728271","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"to have a conversation"}]},{"text":"Можете мне немного помочь?","en":"Can you help me a little?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to help"}]},{"text":"Дай мне ещё немного.","en":"Give me some more.","words":[{"g":"the more insistent form…"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"still / more"},null]}]}